      "extract": "Introduction 1 2. Local Mutation 7 3. SFT Compactness 14 4. Constructing Moduli Space of Broken Maps 30 5. Regularity 44 6. Classifying Rigid Broken Maps 54 7. Floer Cohomology and Mutations 65 References 72 1. Introduction A natural question about Lagrangian submanifolds is how their invariants change if one locally modifies a Lagrangian. We describe a local modification for Lagrangians that contain a torus segment",
